    "keyConcept": "AWS Skill Builder — plataforma on-demand",
    "compareWith": [
     "Skill Builder vs re/Start vs Educate"
    ],
    "realWorldContext": "Equipes corporativas usam Team subscription para programa interno de upskilling.",
    "commonMistakes": "Confundir com platform de partners — é AWS Training oficial.",
    "tutorSeeds": [
