  '{
    "summary": "Dedicated Instance e Dedicated Host garantem hardware fisico isolado por conta AWS.",
    "whyCorrect": "Ambas tenancies isolam hardware fisico (sem outros clientes naquele host). Diferenca: Host expoe sockets/cores, Instance nao.",
    "whyWrong": {
     "A": "Default shared usa multi-tenant.",
     "C": "Spot nao e tenancy.",
     "D": "Reserved nao e tenancy, e modelo de compra."
